<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT - Wait to buy Thai banks - Asset Plus.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wait to buy Thai banks - Asset Plus.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors should wait for operating conditions to improve or stock prices to fall before buying shares of leading Thai banks, Asset Plus Securities recommended in a report on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Bangkok Bank Plc's fundamentals are the best of the Thai banks, but this is already in the share price ... We would wait for a substantial consolidation before buying,&quot; the report said.</p>
</text>
